{"product_id":"the-playbook-suit-up-score-chicks-be-awesome-bro-code","title":"The Playbook: Suit up. Score chicks. Be awesome. (Bro Code)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBestselling author of The Bro Code, Barney Stinson of How I Met Your Mother fame, presents The Playbook—like Neil Strauss’s The Game for Bros, The Playbook offers advice on the many creative and resourceful ways Barney’s developed to wine, dine, and score with “The Ladies.”Since the dawn of history man has searched for the answer to the most fundamental of questions: “Why am I here…not banging chicks?” The search is over. Now, with the help of The Playbook, you’ll be able to approach any beautiful woman, discover her innermost passion, and use that to trick her into sleeping with you. You’ll master more than seventy-five seduction techniques, developed by pickup guru and all-around good guy Barney Stinson, guaranteed to turn you into a bona fide ladies’ man. Featuring the famous plays including:· The Lorenzo Von Matterhorn· Mrs. Stinsfire· The Ted Mosby· The Time Traveler· The “SNASA”· The Scuba Diver· The “He’s Not Coming”…and other greatest hits from Barney Stinson’s secret Playbook of legendary moves. So suit up and get ready to be schooled in awesomeness.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Barney Stinson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781439196830\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 141\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45659183546521,"sku":"6RC9781439196830","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a6a034b5884_The_Playbook-_Suit_up._Score_chicks._Be_awesome.__Bro_Code__Barney_Stinson.jpg?v=1755764005","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-playbook-suit-up-score-chicks-be-awesome-bro-code","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}